"""Finance — beginner guides for accounting/finance jobs and professional qualifications.

Facts checked on 2026-10-12 against official sources: ICAI prospectus (New Scheme of Education and Training) and
ICAI press release on CA Final thrice a year; ICMAI CMA Prospectus (Syllabus 2022); ICSI 'About CS Course' and
Restructured CSEET announcement (effective June 2026); ACCA exam, options, PER and future-qualification pages;
CFA Institute program, exam, policies and Level III pathways pages; NISM certification pages (V-A, VIII, XV,
X-A/X-B); SAP Learning (C_TS4FI); Tally Education; Corporate Finance Institute (FMVA); GST portal.
No salary figures are given because there is no official source for them.
"""
